  "releaseNotes": "The LC045 code fix now handles a query widened to IEnumerable<T>. IEnumerable<Order> source = db.Orders; was diagnostic-only because Include is declared on IQueryable<T>; the fix now lands where the local was given the query, which still converts to the declared type. The local must be declared with a queryable initializer and never reassigned.",
